 # Changelog
 
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+
+- Added UI host API v2: `pi.registerUIHost()` supplies `ctx.ui` from a provider receiving the current `AgentSession` and bound command actions. Interactive mode starts no terminal renderer while Pi retains lifecycle and shutdown ownership. See [UI host](docs/ui-host.md).
+- Added `registerExtensionModule()` so a loaded extension can substitute a module for extensions loaded after it, and `pi.uiHost` in a package manifest to load a UI host extension before the others.
+
 ## [1.4.0] - 2026-10-21
 
 ### New Features
